                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 444,
                            "last_played": 1531377300
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "So I've followed the development of this game for about 5+ years now and lemme tell you I have not been disappointed at all. The methods of combat are different with each character so you have to pay attention to what you're doing as you play and can't just brainlessly grind by mashing A. The characters are all interesting, the story is engaging, and the humor is right down my alley. If you're looking for a fun RPG with interesting mechanics and a fun story I highly recommend picking this game up!",
